ing $AC$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}AC & =\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}0 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 3\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & ={I}_{2}.\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLikewise, computing $CA$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}CA & =\\begin{bmatrix}0 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 3\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 0\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & ={I}_{2}.\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, statement $AC=CA={I}_{2}$ is true.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is $AC=CA={I}_{2}$ only."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186237920 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186087699 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "9b9ef325-2358-5041-8a8d-b459e8ed9f09" :knowledge-point/title "Determining the Inverse of a 2x2 Matrix"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "eccb9532-7de2-59e7-a82e-6ab5c5c256d4" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461207} {:answer/id #uuid "a25d5fdd-a31e-51b5-a9cb-b9b85d9e48e5" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461208}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "a25d5fdd-a31e-51b5-a9cb-b9b85d9e48e5" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461208} :answer-field/id #uuid "3a04379d-5378-57ac-8c8a-5c79d6defc9c" :answer-field/key "$AB=BA={I}_{2}$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186462357} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2a26ee96-ebd3-5ef0-a937-f4248c9f7f8d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461209} {:answer/id #uuid "7a779c6b-ec23-5c8c-8565-47792308afae" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/t