olution "- First, we check whether $AB=BA={I}_{2}.$ Computing $AB$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}AB & =\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & 4 \\\\ 0 & -1\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & -2 \\\\ 0 & -1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}2 & ∗ \\\\ ∗ & ∗\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & \\ne {I}_{2}.\\,\\times \\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, statement $AB=BA={I}_{2}$ is false. As a result, $B\\ne {A}^{-1}$ and statement $B\\ne {A}^{-1}$ is true.\n\n- Now, we check whether $AC=CA={I}_{2}.$ Computing $AC$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}AC & =\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & 4 \\\\ 0 & -1\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}-\\frac{1}{2} & -2 \\\\ 0 & -1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & ={I}_{2}.\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLikewise, computing $CA$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}CA & =\\begin{bmatrix}-\\frac{1}{2} & -2 \\\\ 0 & -1\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & 4 \\\\ 0 & -1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & ={I}_{2}.\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, statement $AC=CA={I}_{2}$ is true.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is $AC=CA={I}_{2}$; $B\\ne {A}^{-1}$ only."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186237975 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186175956 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "60f61c26-ff2d-5343-becd-d8f44f623cd3" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying True Statements Regarding the Convergence of a Power Series"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "6ce59552-42d8-50fa-a897-42349ebc16b5" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461237} {:answer/id #uuid "7bb50c65-9777-5d34-aa33-37b64205dc2b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461238}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "6ce59552-42d8-50fa-a897-42349ebc16b5" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461237} :ans