\\frac{x}{y}}$ only."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186244194 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186147456 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "eef27d2b-6149-5070-b711-f4dcc7db2a03" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying Bernoulli Differential Equations"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "75270618-7af7-5381-9066-6d3469656acb" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461515} {:answer/id #uuid "67390882-204b-5352-ad1e-ccec65f496a7" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461516}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "75270618-7af7-5381-9066-6d3469656acb" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461515} :answer-field/id #uuid "b208e569-82a8-5d09-9cd4-e626e88672d8" :answer-field/key "${y}^{2}{y}^{′}-x{y}^{5}={y}^{4}$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186462511} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "04b1fb51-971c-5aa9-804d-0ccdfcc7a696" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461517} {:answer/id #uuid "c7880ef3-333f-5868-b08a-8422f8cfd792" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461518}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "04b1fb51-971c-5aa9-804d-0ccdfcc7a696" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461517} :answer-field/id #uuid "917fdd71-e52e-5156-b297-f58247d19d0f" :answer-field/key "$y{y}^{′}-x\\sqrt{y}={x}^{2}$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186462512} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "5587940f-b2d2-50f4-8efe-1abc1acf4aab" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461519} {:answer/id #uuid "41170317-0947-57dc-838f-57dc269df7a6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461520}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "5587940f-b2d2-50f4-8efe-1abc1acf4aab" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461519} :answer-field/id #uuid "03ac02f9-35ab-51dd-af88-ea5627438f45" :answer-field/key "${y}^{′}+y\\operatorname{ln}⁡x=x\\operatorname{ln}⁡y$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186462513} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "f8c6fa98-1086-5078-afc2-610a6e78171a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186667822} {:answer/id #uuid "9b99ccc6-dc62-536d-84bf-3cf54fe6f750" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186667823}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "9b99ccc6-dc62-536d-84bf-3cf54fe6f750" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186667823} :answer-field/id #uuid "ec80501f-be65-5cb6-b82a-55b8ce8f9653" :answer-field/key "None of the above" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186668188}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "c444e682-8c21-501d-82e3-dbe63de4e200" :question/math-academy-id "q-108916" :question/problem "Which of the following equations is a Bernoulli differential equation?\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "A Bernoulli differential equation has the form\n\n$$\n\\frac{dy}{dx}+p(x)y=q(x){y}^{n},\n$$\n\nwhere $n$ is a real number.\n\nWith that in mind, let's examine the given options.\n\n- Equation ${y}^{2}{y}^{′}-x{y}^{5}={y}^{4}$ is *not* a Bernoulli differential equation. If we attempt to write the equation in standard form, we get\n\n$$\n{y}^{′}-x{y}^{3}={y}^{2}\n$$\n\nand this is not a Bernoulli differential equation because it is missing the $p(x)y$ term.\n\n- Equation ${y}^{2}{y}^{′}-x{y}^{5}={y}^{4}$ is *not* a Bernoulli differential equation. If we attempt to write the equation in standard form, we get\n\n$$\n{y}^{′}-\\frac{x}{\\sqrt{y}}=\\frac{{x}^{2}}{y}\n$$\n\nand this is not a Bernoulli differential equation because it is missing the $p(x)y$ term.\n\n- Equation ${y}^{′}+y\\operatorname{ln}⁡x=x\\operatorname{ln}⁡y$ is *not* a Bernoulli differential equation. It is missing the $q(x){y}^{n}$ term.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"None of the given equations is a Bernoulli differential equation.\""} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186244195 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186147456 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "eef27d2b-6149-5070-b711-f4dcc7db2a03" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying Bernoulli Differential Equations"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "25a64257-013e-5f8d-b152-d9e7634b93e3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461521} {:answer/id #uuid "44f88025-dd1b-5198-a95d-7ba9a5e96e82" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461522}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "25a64257-013e-5f8d-b152-d9e7634b93e3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186461521} :answer-field/id #uuid "d4513080-f5de-5d9a-b8bd-7e3281ab4ff6" :answer-field/key "${y}^{′}-{e}^{x}{y}^{2}=\\sqrt{y}$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 1