a,b]$ is a finite sequence of real numbers taken from $[a,b]$ such that\n\n$$\na={x}_{0}<{x}_{1}<{x}_{2}<…<{x}_{n}=b\\,.\n$$\n\nWe can express $P$ using set notation as\n\n$$\nP={{x}_{0},{x}_{1},…,{x}_{n}}.\n$$\n\n \n\nWith that in mind, let's consider each statement:\n\n- Statement ${-10,-9,-8,-4,-2}$ is a partition of $[-10,-2].$\n\n- Statement ${-9,-5,-4,-2}$ is not a partition of $[-10,-2]$  since it does not include the left endpoint $a=-10.$\n\n- Statement $-10<-6<-4<-3$ is not a partition of $[-10,-2]$ since it does not include the right endpoint $b=-2.$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is ${-10,-9,-8,-4,-2}$ only."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186256749 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186179723 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "2bc800b0-3901-5154-81ac-1ef853017320" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying Partitions of the Real Line"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "26715d5c-8967-5870-a32d-f0e7de04504e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186462097} {:answer/id #uuid "cffe34d1-2420-5409-9740-ce2cb5bd06e5" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186462098}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "26715d5c-8967-5870-a32d-f0e7de04504e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186462097} :answer-field/id #uuid "59a63827-ba0c-5262-83e4-7514a1d6d98a" :answer-field/key "${-3,-5,1,2,6}$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186462802} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "5500db0b-5028-5ca1-9101-be045fa07fbd" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186462099} {:answer/id #uuid "f59f0c27-693f-5b74-9c2c-1f1aaecba22c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 1