Statement ${-1,0,2}$ is not a partition of  $[-1,1]$ since $2$ does not belong to $[-1,1].$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is $-1<0<\\frac{1}{2}<1$ only."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186259500 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186133880 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "4f47e201-105a-579a-8cde-fcb6bf8cfa2a" :knowledge-point/title "Interpreting Divergence"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "bdadf6b7-b5f9-5ff7-9423-ee3c12b80906" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437696} {:answer/id #uuid "7afe5777-93e3-5e99-a2e4-41abc2620fde" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437697}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "bdadf6b7-b5f9-5ff7-9423-ee3c12b80906" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437696} :answer-field/id #uuid "56b6426b-0fec-5055-bd39-2d631eea5084" :answer-field/key "$∇\\cdot F=0$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438877} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "4ee82610-209a-5b78-b3d9-815a176668e2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437698} {:answer/id #uuid "218da758-973f-597f-9d25-7e96cca48a13" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437699}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "218da758-973f-597f-9d25-7e96cca48a13" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437699} :answer-field/id #uuid "cf1d5aa2-61f4-5ae5-820b-1c0a43cd6b89" :answer-field/key "$∇\\cdot F>0$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db