e interval $(-2,4)$ is not closed, so the extreme value theorem is not applicable.\n\nIn conclusion, the correct answer is $[-2,4]$ only."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186262991 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186175903 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "3bbc6a2d-2078-50d5-9584-c705c19212da" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying Intervals on Which a Given Function Satisfies the Extreme Value Theorem"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "7a46fb56-644a-52f0-b313-5e7bb7296c00" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186463724} {:answer/id #uuid "79364f0e-086b-52ea-a70c-98b26093b5ab" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186463725}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "7a46fb56-644a-52f0-b313-5e7bb7296c00" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186463724} :answer-field/id #uuid "bea28426-10d7-5367-be49-f9c216ba0970" :answer-field/key "$[0,1]$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186464796} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2caf7ff4-d4d3-51ec-b209-02f78bbef9ce" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186463726} {:answer/id #uuid "3513db20-a183-5a09-9093-a24780dd583c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186463727}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "3513db20-a183-5a09-9093-a24780dd583c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186463727} :answer-field/id #uuid "539674c1-9778-54fc-8ed5-d2938d0d680c" :answer-field/key "$[1,2]$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :a