\\operatorname{ln}⁡(\\operatorname{sin}⁡x)?$   \n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "Remember that the extreme value theorem is only applicable to closed intervals on which the function is continuous. \n\nWith that in mind, let's take a look at each interval.\n\n- The interval $[0,1]$ is closed, but the function is not continuous on it because it is not defined at $x=0.$  Therefore, the extreme value theorem is not applicable.\n\n- The interval $[1,2]$ is closed, and the function is continuous on $[1,2].$ Therefore, the extreme value theorem is applicable.\n\n- The interval $(0,2)$  is not closed, so the extreme value theorem is not applicable.\n\nIn conclusion, the correct answer is $[1,2]$ only."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186262992 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186175903 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "3bbc6a2d-2078-50d5-9584-c705c19212da" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying Intervals on Which a Given Function Satisfies the Extreme Value Theorem"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "bee3cea9-55a4-5c7c-8ac7-4a8baa2c63f1" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186463730} {:answer/id #uuid "09e020d5-3c70-54da-b53d-6eba7f5650c9" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186463731}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "09e020d5-3c70-54da-b53d-6eba7f5650c9" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186463731} :answer-field/id #uuid "d55f080a-d818-518b-bd83-3e4ed380033e" :answer-field/key "$[-1,1]$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186464799} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "24fe6757-8bd3-5443-bf45-432fd9692965" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186463732} {:answer/id #uuid "c9c2af09-8a53-559a-83f0-8d0116085541" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186463733}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "24fe6757-8bd3-5443-bf45-432fd9692965" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186463732} :answer-field/id #uuid "3a98f0d4-0b59-5c74-a289-bf84906c6477" :answer-field/key "$[-2,2]$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186464800} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "400c9d55-5311-5b08-8cb0-f547f1c123eb" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186463734} {:answer/id #uuid "b93dc3a4-8f2d-58b2-8b7f-4080c7191f8b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186463735}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "b93dc3a4-8f2d-58b2-8b7f-4080c7191f8b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186463735} :answer-field/id #uuid "965a8d85-7457-5ff1-af8d-5d875ce89893" :answer-field/key "$[0,1]$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186464801} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2c7eae97-a192-5d73-99d8-9e31dd0766b3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186667942} {:answer/id #uuid "70804542-596f-5b72-bb42-0ca16a308b64" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186667943}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "2c7eae97-a192-5d73-99d8-9e31dd0766b3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186667942} :answer-field/id #uuid "531d2a2e-fd9d-5fe9-ad51-de59633cfd42" :answer-field/key "None of the above" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186668248}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "544d2c05-bab6-51a7-b5ca-3e8cac39da3c" :question/math-academy-id "q-129223" :question/problem "On which of the following intervals can the extreme value theorem be applied to the function $y=\\frac{\\sqrt[3]{x}}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡x}?$   \n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "Remember that the extreme value theorem is only applicable to closed intervals on which the function is continuous. \n\nWith that in mind, let's take a look at each interval.\n\n- The intervals $[-1,1]$ and $[0,1]$ are closed, and the function is continuous on each of these intervals. Therefore, the extreme value theorem is applicable on each $[-1,1]$  and $[0,1].$\n\n- The interval $[-2,2]$ is closed, but the function is not continuous on it because it is not defined at $x=\\pm \\frac{\\pi }{2}.$  Therefore, the extreme value theorem is not applicable.\n\nIn conclusion, the correct answer is $[-1,1]$; $[0,1]$ only."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186265783 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186152198 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "0ad76e6b-acef-5221-8852-71dc42625bf3" :knowledge-point/title "Determining a Correct Function Used to Define a Double Integral Over a Non-Rectangular Domain"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "74a8a907-3b80-5bad-9a29-30a21856511a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186463802} {:answer/id #uuid "e0530774-b067-5d2a-af75-a41f92c3bbd4" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 175